  "metadata": {
    "title": "《點石齋畫報》上海同仁醫院個案二則",
    "roman_title": "Dian shi zhai hua bao: Zhuo shou cheng chun and Tou shang sheng tou",
    "author": "《點石齋畫報》編刊者（圖款分錄，正文無署名）",
    "date": "光緒十年（1884）乙十一；光緒二十一年（1895）書四",
    "location": "München",
    "repository": "巴伐利亞邦立圖書館（Bayerische Staatsbibliothek）",
    "collection": "點石齋畫報，第 1、4 函",
    "shelfmark": "L.sin. K 175-1/10 與 L.sin. K 175-31/37",
    "catalogue": "https://opacplus.bsb-muenchen.de/title/BV040390393",
    "language": "lzh",
    "description": "上海虹口同仁醫院的兩則個案刊於《點石齋畫報》。1884 年〈著手成春〉報導一名婦人因大瘤求醫，就診後由女醫施治。1895 年〈頭上生頭〉記家屬抱初生兒前來診視，院內女醫轉報會診，諸醫因嬰兒體弱建議延後手術。兩篇為晚清報刊如何呈現女醫、患者就醫與院內照護決策的史料。",
    "description_en": "Two illustrated reports in the Dianshizhai Pictorial describe patients at Tongren (St Luke's) Hospital in Shanghai. The 1884 article Zhuo shou cheng chun describes a woman with a large growth and her treatment by a woman physician. The 1895 article Tou shang sheng tou describes a family bringing a newborn to the hospital, where an attending woman physician sought consultation and the doctors recommended postponing surgery. The reports document how the late Qing illustrated press represented women physicians, care seeking and clinical decisions.",
    "txt_reader_statement": "題名、刊號、畫款、印和圖內可定位的小字另列。各面直欄從右往左。文末附兩篇連讀全文。□ 表示未定字。",
    "tei_editorial_statement": "〈著手成春〉取第192幅左半；〈頭上生頭〉取第434幅同一開面。依原圖讀序保留圖說文字、原刊版記及題署；印記和未明的圖內小字保留原圖位置。",
